# KVM/libvirt compartmentalization (installer option "VM isolation").
# Lets you run risky apps or a whole workstation inside a VM whose only route out
# is Tor — the Whonix model. Strong isolation, but NOT a Xen type-1 hypervisor,
# so not literally Qubes (see docs/DESIGN.md).
qemu-system-x86
qemu-system-arm
qemu-utils
libvirt-daemon-system
libvirt-clients
virt-manager
bridge-utils
dnsmasq-base
ovmf
